The skill evolution cycle was executed successfully. Through parallel candidate generation and best-of-N selection, the **Knowledge Supervisor** agent has been successfully evolved, raising its performance from a **38.5%** baseline meaningful rate to a perfect **100.0%** meaningful rate.

