### 1. Quality Performance Metrics
* **Baseline (v0)**: **38.5%** Meaningful Rate | **61.5%** Unhelpful Rate (13 Sessions, 8 Failures)
* **Round 1 (v1)**: **100.0%** Meaningful Rate | **0.0%** Unhelpful Rate (13 Sessions, 0 Failures)
